{"change_summary":"Updated the user-visible chemistry surfaces so threshold event summaries now spell out NH3-N and N-basis units, the overview screen restores GH/KH derivation labels plus 7-ion TDS and conductivity estimate units, and API snapshot responses now emit legacy chemistry keys alongside the explicit renamed fields with semantics/scope metadata for the 7-ion estimate.","outstanding_risks":["Repository has unrelated pre-existing modifications in `crates/tank_core/src/invariants.rs`, several `tank_core` tests, and `.ralph-burning/`; they were left untouched.","The overview copy change was validated with `cargo check -p tank_tui`, but there is still no dedicated render test asserting the exact TUI text."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected the event, snapshot/API, and overview paths called out in the review feedback.","order":0,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Changed threshold event summaries to include explicit chemistry bases and added regression coverage for the rendered text.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Expanded overview chemistry/system copy to show GH/KH derivation labels plus estimated 7-ion TDS and conductivity units.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Centralized API snapshot serialization behind helpers that emit legacy chemistry aliases and semantics metadata on `/snapshot`, `/snapshot/chemistry`, `/time/step`, `/load`, and scenario-load responses.","order":3,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran targeted tests and compile checks for the touched crates.","order":4,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo fmt --all` completed successfully.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test events` passed (7 tests), including the new explicit-unit summary regression.","`cargo test -p tank_api` passed (2 tests), covering legacy chemistry aliases and 7-ion estimate semantics metadata.","`cargo check -p tank_tui` completed successfully after the overview copy changes."]}